  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ra&#xf1;a Tsimorum Health Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Rana Tsimorum Health Program is a whole-of-health program that seeks to ensure that Nauru&#x2019;s health system is better able to respond to health threats and effectively deliver inclusive quality health services and population-level interventions for the people of Nauru, through strengthened engagement and partnership with Australia. It is made up of three components: health system strengthening, health service delivery, and inclusive health.</narrative>
  </description>
